    "role": "A shared wind shaft changes jobs after an empty-handed lower loop.",
    "solution": "Carry the lantern beneath the shaft beam and ride the west draft to the high pressure shelf. Set the lantern on the plate, descend empty-handed, and cross the low gate. Use the pod and receiving shelf to reach the hanging vane. Climb to its pivot and turn it into the bridge to the lantern shelf. Retrieve the same lantern, cross the new bridge and ride the diverted east draft to the high exit gallery.",
